Package: POPSR
Type: Package
Title: R Interface of POPS
Version: 3.5
Authors@R: c(person("Jens", "Kleinjung", role  = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
                     email = "jens@jkleinj.eu"),
             person("Franca", "Fraternali", role  = c("aut", "cph"),
                     email = "franca.fraternali@kcl.ac.uk"))
Author: Jens Kleinjung, Franca Fraternali
Maintainer: Jens Kleinjung <jens@jkleinj.eu> 
Description: The package serves as a front-end to the POPS program,
  either in the R environment (popscomp.R) or as a Shiny server (app.R).
  It serves additionally as a source for SASA plotting functions
  (plotSASA.R) and to process protein complexes on-the-fly in the
  spirit of POPSCOMP.
Depends: R (>= 3.5),
		 bio3d (>= 2.3)
Imports: ggplot2 (>= 3.2),
         grDevices,
         graphics,
         utils
Suggests: knitr,
          rmarkdown,
          shiny (>= 1.4),
          DT,
          digest,
          markdown,
          shinysky
Additional_repositories: https://github.com/AnalytixWare/ShinySky
Collate: popscomp.R plotSASA.R runApp.R
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/Fraternalilab/POPScomp
BugReports: https://github.com/Fraternalilab/POPScomp/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 6.1.1
VignetteBuilder: knitr
SystemRequirements: POPS (the C program of the POPScomp package); its
  location is taken from the POPS_BIN environment variable or from the PATH
